\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
This paper was a response to Krueger (1993), who used rich observational
 data to argue that computers increased wages.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
There was a concern with the original study.
 Computer users are fundamentally different from non-computer users (i.e.,
 white collar vs.
 blue collar) even after controlling for observable characteristics
\end_layout

